<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX SIGNS $1.5 MLN COCA DEALS.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX SIGNS $1.5 MLN COCA DEALS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA signed six contracts with Coca Cola on carrying out construction works in its factories in Ukraine and Bielarus worth total $1.5 million, Budimex said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the works should be finished by February 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
